 Appartement S3 à vendre aux Jardins de Carthage </a> </h2> </div> <div class="item-price-block hide-on-grid"> <span class="item-price"> 650 000 DT </span> </div> </div> <div class="item-body-bottom"> <ul class="item-amenities"> <li class="h-beds"><span>3</span>Chambres</li> <li class="h-area"><span>157</span>m²</li> </ul> <ul class="item-date"> <li class="prop-user-agent"> <i class="fa fa-user"></i> <a href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/agent/110-new-key-jardins-de-carthage"> New Key Jardins De Carthage </a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-md-12 text-right mt-4"> <a href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/opportunites" class="btn btn-secondary" title="Voir plus"> Voir plus </a> </div> </div> </div> <div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" data-vc-stretch-content="true" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1559676507527 vc_row-has-fill vc_row-no-padding vc_row-o-content-middle vc_row-flex"> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1582450954395"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2><span style="font-size: 48px;"><span style="line-height: 60px;">Nous Sommes New Key</span></span> </h2> <p>New Key Immobilier est un réseau d’agences immobilières en Tunisie, présent à la Marsa, aux Berges du Lac et aux Jardins de Carthage. Les conseillers Newkey sont à votre disposition pour estimer votre bien immobilier. Une estimation fiable est la définition du prix optimum de mise en vente de votre bien. Ce prix optimum n’est ni le prix apparent, ni le prix bradé mais le prix réel établi à partir des transactions réalisées récemment pour des biens équivalents sur le même secteur.</p></div> </div> <div class="vc_btn3-container btn vc_btn3-inline vc_custom_1561747654039"> <a style="background-color:#fdc613; color:#ffffff;" class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-rounded vc_btn3-style-custom" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/a-propos/" title="">Notre Groupe</a></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"> <div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1531535355999"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left vc_custom_1580023248262"> <figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure"> <div class="vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_border_grey"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDgwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==" class="vc_single_image-img " data-src="assets/images/new-key-immobilier-la-marsa-min.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="photo agence immobiliere la marsa" title="new key immobilier la marsa-min"/> <noscript><img class="vc_single_image-img " src="assets/images/new-key-immobilier-la-marsa-min.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="photo agence immobiliere la marsa" title="new key immobilier la marsa-min"/></noscript> </div> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div> <div style="padding-bottom: 50px" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1559676583230"> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid"> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element "> <div class="wpb_wrapper"><h3> Découvrez Nos Biens Sur La Banlieue Nord De Tunis </h3></div> </div> <div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 32px"> <span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LA MARSA" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/la-marsa"> <div class="ville"> LA MARSA </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="GAMMARTH" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/gammarth"> <div class="ville"> GAMMARTH </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="SIDI BOU SAID" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/area/sidi-bousaid"> <div class="ville"> SIDI BOU SAID </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="CARTHAGE" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/carthage"> <div class="ville"> CARTHAGE </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LES JARDINS DE CARTHAGE" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/state/jardins-de-carthage"> <div class="ville"> LES JARDINS DE CARTHAGE </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LES BERGES DU LAC 1" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/area/les-berges-du-lac-1"> <div class="ville"> LES BERGES DU LAC 1 </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LES BERGES DU LAC 2" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/area/les-berges-du-lac-2"> <div class="ville"> LES BERGES DU LAC 2 </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="AIN ZAGHOUAN NORD" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/ain-zaghouan-nord"> <div class="ville"> AIN ZAGHOUAN NORD </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="AIN ZAGHOUAN" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/ain-zaghouan"> <div class="ville"> AIN ZAGHOUAN </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LA SOUKRA" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/la-soukra"> <div class="ville"> LA SOUKRA </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LES JARDINS DE L'AOUINA" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/les-jardins-de-l-aouina"> <div class="ville"> LES JARDINS DE L'AOUINA </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="L'AOUINA" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/l-aouina"> <div class="ville"> L'AOUINA </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LES BERGES DU LAC 3" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/area/les-berges-du-lac-3"> <div class="ville"> LES BERGES DU LAC 3 </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LE KRAM" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/le-kram"> <div class="ville"> LE KRAM </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="LA GOULETTE" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/la-goulette"> <div class="ville"> LA GOULETTE </div> </a> </div> <div class="vc_col-md-2 city-select"> <a title="TUNIS" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/city/tunis"> <div class="ville"> TUNIS </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div> <div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" data-vc-parallax="1.5" data-vc-parallax-image="assets/images/18016840_29-1.webp" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row-has-fill vc_row-o-full-height vc_row-o-columns-middle vc_row-o-content-middle vc_row-flex vc_general vc_parallax vc_parallax-content-moving"> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1 vc_hidden-sm vc_hidden-xs"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"></div> </div> </div> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-10"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1531771927286 vc_row-has-fill"> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element "> <div class="wpb_wrapper"><h4 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 36px;"><span style="line-height: 60px;">Estimez Votre Bien Gratuitement</span></span> </h4> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Obtenez l’estimation la plus juste de la valeur de votre bien immobilier grâce à l’expertise des conseillers New Key en la matière. L’estimation de valeur de votre bien à la vente ou à la location prend en compte plusieurs facteurs tels que la conjoncture du marché au moment de la conclusion de la transaction et le prix moyen des transactions de vente ou de location constaté sur la même période.</span> </p></div> </div> <div class="text-center"> <a class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit" href="https://www.newkey.com.tn/proposer-un-bien">Estimez Votre Bien</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1 vc_hidden-sm vc_hidden-xs"> <div class="vc_column-inner"> <div class="wpb_wrapper"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div> </div></div> <button class="scrolltop-btn back-top"><i class="fa fa-angle-up"></i></button><footer id="footer-section"> <div class="footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12"> <div class="footer-widget widget_text"> <div class="widget-top"> <img data-lazyloaded="1" style="width: 60%" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDMiIGhlaWdodD0iOTQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyMDMgOTQiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIGZpbGw9IiNjZmQ0ZGIiLz48L3N2Zz4=" loading="lazy" class="wp-image-40140" data-src="https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0" alt="" width="203" height="94" data-srcset="https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 300w, https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 1024w, https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 768w, https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 150w, https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 350w, https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 1034w, https://www.newkey.com.tn/assets/images/logo_newkey_blancjaune.svg?v=0 1476w" data-sizes="(max-width: 203px) 100vw, 203px"/> <noscript><img loading="lazy" style="width: 60%" class="wp-image-40140" src="https://www